DESCRIPTION:In anticipation of the 27th annual Woodstock Film Festival the
  WFF team has partnered withGood Neighbor\, the Kingston-based independent
  arts\, culture\, and community publication\, to produce a limited-edition
 \, collectible zine to highlight festival venues\, screenings\, and specia
 l events taking place across the mid-Hudson Valley during festival week in
  October.\n\nJoin us for an evening of drinks and community convergence. M
 eet the Good Neighbor and Woodstock Film Festival teams and help us kick o
 ff the countdown to the 27th Annual Woodstock Film Festival!\n\nA cash bar
  and snacks will be available for purchase at Unicorn Bar during the event
 . Stay after for Queer Line Dancing in the ballroom! Admission is separate
  and on $5 - $25 sliding scale.\n\nSpecial Thanks to our Zine Sponsors:\n
 \nBy RSVPing for this event\, you acknowledge and agree that the name and 
